920:   /**
921:    * Transforms a failure of the given type (potentially into a value) by applying the given function to it.
922:    * <p>
923:    * This method is similar to {@link #mapError(Class, Function)}, except that it allows async transformation.
924:    *
925:    * @param function the transformation to apply to the promise failure
926:    * @return a promise
927:    * @since 1.3
928:    */
